WEBVTT

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:05.390
My little sister's at Torneo's
vacation home right now.

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:07.720
Vacation home?
She isn't at his mansion?

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.730
Yes, he goes to his vacation home
every second Saturday without exception.

00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:15.070
So, he takes his hostage with him
to his vacation home on every Saturday, huh?

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.900
Yes... 'cause they
just do crazy stuff.

00:00:21.740 --> 00:00:24.410
W- we might be pretty crazy, too...

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:27.740
There're lots of watchmen
at the front gate, so...

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:38.760
<i>The beating [of an insect's wings]</i>

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:46.100
<i>Lightly, lightly, floating...</i>

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:53.090
<i>Carrying our feelings</i>

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:59.780
<i>That's how it always starts...</i>
<i>under the azure sky</i>

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:06.940
<i>After making a vow,</i>
<i>I now set off</i>

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:26.070
<i>Yeah, the desert glitters with a golden hue</i>
<i>(The wind is scorching)</i>

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:32.410
<i>I'm searching for a diamond flower</i>
<i>(I keep on wandering)</i>

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:38.750
<i>Now, for the first time in my life,</i>

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:45.090
<i>I live for someone else</i>

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:51.590
<i>There's something</i>
<i>I wanna protect</i>

00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:58.100
<i>I'll never,</i>
<i>ever lose it again</i>

00:01:58.100 --> 00:02:01.100
<i>Resound,</i>
<i>my heartbeat!</i>

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:11.100
<i>A heartbeat smaller and fragile,</i>
<i>but tougher than anyone's.</i>

00:02:24.230 --> 00:02:27.890
"Cat in the Darkness"

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:35.400
Wh- what the hell is going on?

00:02:35.400 --> 00:02:37.400
He's alive...

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:41.410
Apparently, they were all knocked
unconscious by one blow...

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:45.900
Sven-<i>san</i>! Looks like
she's in a room upstairs...

00:03:04.360 --> 00:03:06.360
B- Black Cat!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.700
Hold it!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:12.370
You again...
Stay out of my way!

00:03:12.370 --> 00:03:13.670
Not a chance!

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:17.040
I've got a huge pile of bills, and...
No, what I mean is...

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:19.380
You'd just point your gun
at a child like that!?

00:03:19.380 --> 00:03:21.870
Please! Let that girl go!!

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:27.050
This is what I do...

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:29.890
So, you're just Chronos'
pet cat after all...

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.730
Blood...

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.220
This smells of blood.

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.730
The game's over!

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.010
Just drop your guns
and raise your hands.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:02.020
Well, well...
Welcome, my guests.

00:04:02.020 --> 00:04:04.360
So the final boss
shows himself, huh?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:09.700
But you're a little too dangerous
to be called guests.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:12.700
We're fitting guests for you,
aren't we?

00:04:12.700 --> 00:04:17.700
This guest talks a lot.
But the smart remarks end here.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:20.370
Sorry, but I'll have
to ask my guests...

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.310
...to disappear now.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.740
H- hey!
No!!!

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:52.740
Shoot! Shoot!!

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.470
Wait! You're gonna shoot Eve!!

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.360
B- Black Cat...

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.700
No matter how many rats
sneak into my place,

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:27.700
they'll just become prey
for my masterpiece.

00:05:42.720 --> 00:05:48.060
It's now morning, but it seems like
they're not after us, doesn't it?

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:51.730
Wh- why are you dressed like that?

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:56.400
You have to be well-groomed,
even if it's just for making coffee.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.410
That's gentleman's
etiquette, you know...

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:02.170
Gentleman's... huh?

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:05.850
Well...

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:10.680
Isn't it about time
for you to tell me the truth?

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:11.740
What?

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:19.030
It's no use hiding it.

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:24.030
You wouldn't refer to your own
sister as "that girl", right?

00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:27.030
Also, why would Black Cat
be after your little sister?

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:29.370
You don't have to think very hard
to realize something's odd, right?

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:32.370
I've known that something was up
ever since you told me

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.710
that she was kidnapped by Torneo...

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:38.700
Miss Rinslet Walker,
the ace female thief...

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:44.380
Now that you've figured it out,
I guess I have no choice...

00:06:44.380 --> 00:06:49.380
Well done, Sven Vollfied,
ex-IBI agent...

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:53.550
So, what are you after?

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:01.000
That girl...

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:04.000
...is the ultimate bio-weapon.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:06.670
Bio-weapon?

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:11.010
Are you familiar
with nanotechnology?

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:13.180
I've heard of it...

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:16.680
There's a type of engineering that uses
micro-robots called nanomachines,

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:20.690
which are a nano-meter in size.

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:23.020
That's nanotechnology...

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:27.530
It was supposed to be used for things like
helping to overcome intractable diseases

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:29.030
by altering the structure of DNA,

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:33.700
and creating new materials
by rearranging molecules, but...

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.040
But?

00:07:35.040 --> 00:07:41.370
You've heard about that military facility
that collapsed a few years ago, haven't you?

00:07:41.370 --> 00:07:46.710
If I remember correctly, an ammunition dump
within the facility exploded, right?

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:49.720
The one that caused the deaths
of more than 10,000 people...

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:52.720
That was a tragic accident...

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:56.060
What if it wasn't an accident?

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:57.060
You don't mean!

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:00.330
It was Torneo who caused that accident.

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:05.670
His goal was to steal nanotechnology that
was sealed within the military facility,

00:08:05.670 --> 00:08:09.670
and to have it traded
as a military weapon...

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:15.680
No way. Are you saying he caused
that many deaths for that?

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.340
Then-!

00:08:17.340 --> 00:08:18.680
That's right.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:24.020
The ultimate bio-weapon created
using that stolen nanotechnology is...

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:30.690
That girl... Eve, huh?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:35.390
And, your goal would be to steal
that nanotechnology data, huh?

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.370
Of course!
What else would it be!?

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:47.710
If I take that data back to the military,
I'll get a huge reward for it!

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:52.050
This is like hitting the jackpot,
don't you think!?

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:53.380
Whatever...

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.380
Hey, where're you going!?

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.410
I'm gonna go buy some cigarettes.

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.500
Now it's cold...

00:09:26.680 --> 00:09:29.510
So, you're just Chronos'
pet cat after all...

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:41.360
T- Torneo-<i>sama,</i>
please forgive me!

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:43.700
Please don't kill me!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:47.700
The mistake you made
is worth the ultimate punishment.

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:51.040
I- It was certainly my mistake
that the intruders snuck in

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:55.710
but I didn't expect that Black Cat
to come to your secret vacation home.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:59.710
It wasn't just Black Cat.
You also let two rats into-

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:02.050
Now, hold on, Flit.

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:05.720
If you don't want to die,
then run...

00:10:05.720 --> 00:10:06.710
What?

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:13.390
Don't you get it?
It's a game of "tag".

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:16.730
Run, run, run for your life!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:19.070
Eve!

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:21.400
It's time to play a game of tag.

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.060
Tag...

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:28.610
The one who's it
has to hunt down the prey.

00:10:28.610 --> 00:10:31.080
Understand?

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:34.410
I am...

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:35.470
...it.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.430
The smell of blood...

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:56.440
What's the matter, Eve?
Finish him off!

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:58.770
This isn't...

00:10:58.770 --> 00:11:02.040
This isn't the prey
I'm hunting for...

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:14.720
Yes, sir!

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:15.720
No, don't!

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:19.390
There's still a lot to teach her
about being a weapon...

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:24.400
But, she's a complete success
as she can transform in a split second.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.230
She'll be completed soon... soon.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.910
Wh- What happened?

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.750
Out of the way...

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:42.750
You...

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:45.420
What are you doing!?
Go back to your room!

00:11:45.420 --> 00:11:46.750
Out of the way...

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.420
If you don't go back right away-

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:03.700
Two packs of Lamies, ma'am.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:04.800
Okay.

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:09.540
The question is,
what's my next move?

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:48.370
That girl is the ultimate bio-weapon...

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:08.030
Tiptoe, tiptoe, tippytoe...

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:14.710
--You are...
--Yes, yes, yes!

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:17.040
--Who are you?
--Who!? What?

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:28.390
Young lady, what're you doing
in a place like this?

00:13:28.390 --> 00:13:31.390
I...

00:13:31.390 --> 00:13:33.060
...am it.

00:13:33.060 --> 00:13:34.060
What?

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.050
It...

00:13:50.410 --> 00:13:51.410
Where's Eve!?

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:54.750
Y- yes, sir! It seems
that she's not on the premises!

00:13:54.750 --> 00:13:57.080
What!?

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:57.750
Flit!

00:13:57.750 --> 00:13:59.090
Yes, sir!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:03.690
If something happens to Eve,
you know what that means, right?

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:09.190
She's wearing a bracelet
transmitter just in case.

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:16.370
So, young lady, what're you doing
in a place like this?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.710
Where... am I?

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.370
Are you lost?

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:23.380
Lost...

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.210
No...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:27.980
I... am it.

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:36.880
Until I catch him,
I can't finish playing... tag.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:43.820
Oh, I see!

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:50.400
What are you doing here?

00:14:50.400 --> 00:14:54.100
<i>I dare not say that I'm trying</i>
<i>to capture you...</i>

00:14:57.080 --> 00:15:00.070
I just, um...
you know-

00:15:02.350 --> 00:15:07.350
I came to feed the doves!
'Cause they're cute!

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:10.020
Feed?

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:15.030
Well, feed, feed, feed,
feed for the doves...

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:20.030
I used up all the feed earlier
so I don't have any left.

00:15:20.030 --> 00:15:21.190
I see...

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.710
Wait here.
I'll go buy some!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.380
Thank you very much!

00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:31.140
Here, ice cream!

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:38.050
Feed?

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:40.040
First, we have to feed ourselves.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:50.730
It's cold and sweet...

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.900
And yet, the sweetness isn't heavy.

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:55.560
The feeling as it melts
in your mouth is great and-

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:04.170
Here, use this to wipe your mouth.

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:14.690
<i>This is a weapon?</i>

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:17.360
Ice cream...

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:18.690
...tastes good.

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:26.370
Hey, hey, if you're impressed with something
like ice cream, you're in for a treat!

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:28.700
--In for a treat?
--Yeah!

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:32.710
By that I mean there's lots of good food
out there that tastes better than this!

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.040
Good food?

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:37.380
Steak, coffee,
cigarettes and beer...

00:16:37.380 --> 00:16:40.050
Oh, those're <i>my</i> favorites, I guess...

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:44.040
Cakes, chocolates, tiramisu,
tapioca pudding, <i>annin-dofu-</i>

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:49.720
Gentlemen don't like
sweets much, so...

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:54.790
So, there're many... I don't know
much about the outside, so...

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.000
Now, watch.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:02.990
There!

00:17:21.690 --> 00:17:23.690
All right!

00:17:23.690 --> 00:17:26.360
Do you wanna go out
for good food some time!?

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:27.690
Good food?

00:17:27.690 --> 00:17:31.360
Yep! There's a whole lot of good stuff
out there besides sweets!

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:34.630
Curry with rice, hamburger steak,
spaghetti Neapolitan...

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:44.780
Will you take me
to eat good food?

00:17:44.780 --> 00:17:46.710
Yes, it's a promise.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.720
Promise...

00:17:50.720 --> 00:17:53.220
Promise!

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:56.720
Oh, come to think of it, they were selling
crapes at that food stand, too...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:57.880
Wait here!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:14.000
Now, which one shall I get?

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:21.670
--We're going home, Eve.
--Hold it!

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.020
Shit!

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:31.680
Wait!

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.360
Promise...

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:54.710
The smell of blood...

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:56.720
Hi there!

00:18:56.720 --> 00:19:00.320
You're looking better
than I thought, Train.

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:05.320
Shall I give you a hand if you're
having trouble with your mission?

00:19:05.320 --> 00:19:07.320
It's none of your business.

00:19:10.660 --> 00:19:15.330
Did you run into
the bio-weapon girl?

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:17.840
I'm sure it's not the case

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:23.010
that you couldn't shoot because
the target was a child, right?

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:24.740
When it comes to
Numbers' missions,

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:27.010
it doesn't really matter whether
the target is an adult or a child.

00:19:27.010 --> 00:19:31.680
That's my Train! I knew I didn't place
my confidence in you for nothing.

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:35.690
If you're done here,
get lost already!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.120
Transform...

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:46.030
You know what Torneo stole from
a military base a few years ago, don't you?

00:19:46.030 --> 00:19:50.700
That's right. The data
about "nanotechnology".

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:54.370
It's rumored that the attack capability
developed using that nanotechnology...

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:57.710
is the ability to transform.

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:01.050
By altering the sequence
of cells in her body,

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:04.050
she can become a "devil",
an "angel"...

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:06.720
and she can also become
a "silent weapon", too...

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:10.720
<i>That</i> is the "transform" ability...

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:15.390
You met Eve in the park!?
And, you're saying she was taken away!?

00:20:15.390 --> 00:20:16.400
Yeah...

00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:20.730
Why're you so calm!?
Why didn't you bring her back with you!?

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:22.070
Can't be helped...

00:20:22.070 --> 00:20:24.070
"Can't be helped"? But...

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:27.410
There's one thing I found out...

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:29.710
She's not some sort of weapon.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:34.410
She's just a girl who grew up
in a slightly different world.

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:36.080
Even with nanotechnology,

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:39.250
if you use it for good,
it'll take you in the right direction.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:42.420
Torneo Rudman...

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:46.760
As a sweeper, no, as a gentleman,
I won't let you get away with this...

00:20:46.760 --> 00:20:50.760
But it seems that
you don't have to fear...

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:56.770
I heard that the girl isn't
actually complete as a weapon yet.

00:20:56.770 --> 00:21:00.140
Which means that sooner is better
if you want to attack her.

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:06.380
So, what're you gonna do?

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:09.050
So, what're you going to do now?

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:10.550
It's easy!

00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:13.050
I'll make a lot of noise
so that they'll notice.

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:16.390
Then, Torneo'll probably use Eve...

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:19.060
So, that's when you'll attack her!

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:21.730
That's when I'll rescue her.

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:24.060
Then, as I thought...

00:21:24.060 --> 00:21:26.400
I'll head in from the front!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:28.560
I'll set off loud fireworks!

00:21:31.070 --> 00:21:34.740
Wait! No matter what you say,
this is crazy!

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:36.740
Don't worry.
I have a trump card.

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:39.250
T- trump card?

00:21:39.250 --> 00:21:42.810
If it comes down to it, I'll take
a good look at my enemy with both eyes.

00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:47.750
Are you nuts!?
What're you talking about!?

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:51.420
Well, I guess I'll go
keep my promise!

00:21:51.420 --> 00:21:54.090
That's right, Train.

00:21:54.090 --> 00:21:59.260
That's the almighty
human that I want...

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:02.370
Train...

00:22:02.370 --> 00:22:04.700
You're truly above them all!

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:16.380
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:20.380
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:22:20.380 --> 00:22:26.150
<i>Please stop time tonight!</i>

00:22:35.060 --> 00:22:41.070
<i>Please show yourself,</i>
<i>even if just a little</i>

00:22:41.070 --> 00:22:46.840
<i>Around the time the first evening star</i>
<i>appears, I hear footsteps approaching</i>

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:52.750
<i>The only time I can see you</i>
<i>is when the moon is shining</i>

00:22:52.750 --> 00:22:55.750
<i>Please let me dream a little</i>

00:22:55.750 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>'Cause it'll become</i>
<i>an illusion by morning</i>

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:02.360
<i>Even though I know it,</i>
<i>I still feel lonely</i>

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:08.030
<i>The stars in the night sky</i>
<i>are my tears</i>

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:14.040
<i>You held me in your arms</i>
<i>and your passionate lips met mine</i>

00:23:14.040 --> 00:23:17.040
<i>Please don't let go of me</i>

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:20.380
<i>I'm about to melt in your arms</i>

00:23:20.380 --> 00:23:23.210
<i>But morning is almost here</i>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:26.720
<i>Goddess of the moon,</i>
<i>angel of the stars!</i>

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:33.050
<i>I pray to you,</i>
<i>please stop time</i>

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:41.400
"Next Episode"

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:43.500
The super cool thief Rinslet Walker
arrives on the scene!
"Next Episode"

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:45.070
The super cool thief Rinslet Walker
arrives on the scene!

00:23:45.070 --> 00:23:48.740
Rats! I thought I'd just waltz in
and obtain the nanotechnology weapon,

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:50.740
but things don't look too good.

00:23:50.740 --> 00:23:52.740
The weapon's thinking
about something.

00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:55.410
Though it's unlike Sven,
he's developed a father's love,

00:23:55.410 --> 00:23:58.080
and even Chronos' assassin
is now getting involved...

00:23:58.080 --> 00:24:00.680
If things go on like this,
my plan's gonna be ruined!

00:24:00.680 --> 00:24:02.490
How should I put it...
I just wish life could be simpler...

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:05.480
"Smiling Cat"
How should I put it...
I just wish life could be simpler...
